    "detailed_description": "<h1>Other games from our friends</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999870/extras/78682e93340a1dcd29c0ae33df49f253.poster.avif?t=1743586767\" width=615 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999870/extras/78682e93340a1dcd29c0ae33df49f253.webm?t=1743586767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><strong>Doodle Hunt</strong> - a whimsical adventure, a charming seek-and-find game where hand-drawn maps come to life! Explore intricately sketched cityscapes filled with a myriad of items waiting to be discovered. Your task? Spot and colorize the specific objects hidden within these captivating doodles. As you locate the sought-after items, watch them magically burst into color, transforming the once-monochrome scenes into vibrant illustrations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999870/extras/966cae029a67fd499593acbc65715430.poster.avif?t=1743586767\" width=615 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999870/extras/966cae029a67fd499593acbc65715430.webm?t=1743586767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique Hand-Drawn Maps: Navigate through beautifully illustrated maps bursting with personality and charm.<br></li><li>Engaging Seek-and-Find Gameplay: Test your observation skills as you hunt for specific items hidden within each doodle.<br></li><li>Colourful Discovery: Witness the magic of colorisation as you find and interact with each object.<br></li><li>Explore Diverse Locations: Roam through a variety of settings, each with its own set of challenges and surprises.<br></li><li>Relaxing Atmosphere: Enjoy a soothing gameplay experience with no time limits or penalties.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999870/extras/40e7b711e84fcdcb08ee717ee4c10c73.poster.avif?t=1743586767\" width=615 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999870/extras/40e7b711e84fcdcb08ee717ee4c10c73.webm?t=1743586767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Doodle Hunt offers a refreshing take on the classic seek-and-find genre, combining delightful visuals with engaging gameplay. Whether you're seeking a relaxing pastime or a challenge for your keen eyes, this doodle-filled world promises an enchanting experience for players of all ages.<br><br><strong>Ready to embark on a captivating journey through hand-drawn landscapes? Begin your Doodle Hunt today!</strong>",
